# Cycle AGT (TASK-012) — ephemeral MCP config files written by the extension
# when launching Claude Code / Codex sessions. Must NOT be committed: the
# files contain only `127.0.0.1:<port>` endpoint metadata, but they leak
# ephemeral port numbers and are intended to be cleaned up on engine
# dispose. Delete on dispose is the contract; this gitignore entry is a
# safety net for any race where the dispose path didn't run.
.vscode/.unicdb-claude-mcp-*.json
.vscode/.unicdb-codex-mcp-*.json

# bump-version.mjs (release pipeline) — temp notes file written to the repo
# root during `gh release create` and removed in a `finally`. Always clean on
# success, but the gitignore entry is a safety net for an aborted run that
# leaves the file behind. Content is the multi-line CHANGELOG entry for the
# version being released.
.bump-notes-*.md
node_modules_backup/
